## Mandatory: read before implementation

Before writing or modifying code in this project, read the matching rule in `.cursor/rules/` for the task.
Rules are lightweight routers; detailed implementation guidance lives in `.cursor/skills/`.

| Task | Rule file (`.cursor/rules/`) | Skill file (`.cursor/skills/`) |
|---|---|---|
| Any Dart/Flutter implementation (layers, DRY / reuse) | `dart-architecture.mdc` | `dart-architecture/SKILL.md` |
| Creating or modifying a screen | `new-screen.mdc` | `new-screen/SKILL.md` |
| Creating or modifying a model | `new-model.mdc` | `new-model/SKILL.md` |
| Creating or modifying a service | `new-service.mdc` | `new-service/SKILL.md` |
| Any UI work (fonts, colors, sizing) | `theming.mdc` | `theming/SKILL.md` |
| Fade on display, async loading, error + retry | `async-ui-feedback.mdc` | `async-ui-feedback/SKILL.md` |
| Widget lists (`if`/`else` vs ternary), locals only when reused or conditional | `flutter-code-style.mdc` | `flutter-code-style/SKILL.md` |
| Paywall, RevenueCat, or purchase flow | `paywall.mdc` | `payments-core/SKILL.md` |
| Firebase Remote Config | `remote-config.mdc` | `remote-config/SKILL.md` |
| Supabase Edge Functions or Storage | `supabase.mdc` | `supabase/SKILL.md` |
| Creating or modifying a SQL migration (`supabase/migrations/`) | `supabase-migrations.mdc` | `supabase-migrations/SKILL.md` |
| Data fetching / avoiding duplicate DB or PostgREST calls | `database-requests.mdc` | `database-requests/SKILL.md` |
| Firebase Analytics events (registry, new `eventKey`, helper methods) | `analytics-events.mdc` | `analytics-events/SKILL.md` |
| Writing or running Maestro E2E tests (when explicitly requested) | `maestro-testing.mdc` | `maestro-testing/SKILL.md` |
| Revisar app para App Store / Google Play / publicação | `store-compliance.mdc` | `store-compliance/SKILL.md` |
| `.env` keys, API keys, Supabase/RC/Legal/Support config | `env-config.mdc` | `env-config/SKILL.md` |
| Gate pré-produção (keys, branding, builds, Supabase migrations/Edge sync) | — | agent `.cursor/agents/dev-ops-release.md` (`/dev-ops-release`) |
| Subscriptions / payments (RevenueCat) | — | `payments-core/SKILL.md` |

These rules define the non-negotiable architecture and patterns of this project. **The architecture must never be broken.** If a request would require violating a rule, say so explicitly and propose a compliant alternative.

> **Note:** Some skill examples reference other domains (Contract Easy, sticker album, card scanning). Apply only the **patterns** (layers, Riverpod, Freezed, theming, services); ignore domain-specific file names unless they exist in this repo.

