## Evolving rules

If you identify a new pattern or standard that would help the project and is not documented yet, confirm with the user before adding it. Once confirmed:

- New or updated architecture standards → `.cursor/rules/` (router) + `.cursor/skills/` (detailed guidance)
- New task-specific patterns → `.cursor/skills/<topic>/SKILL.md` and matching `.cursor/rules/<topic>.mdc`
- Update the reference table above when adding a new rule/skill pair.

