## Commands

```bash
# Install dependencies
flutter pub get

# Code generation (required after changing Freezed models or adding JSON serialization)
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs

# Run the app (keys from root `.env` via flutter_dotenv)
flutter run

# iOS release (unsigned; sign in Xcode / Archive)
flutter build ios --release --no-codesign

# Android release AAB
flutter build appbundle --release

# Lint / static analysis
flutter analyze

# Analytics registry (run after changing analytics_events.json or FirebaseAnalyticsHelper)
flutter test test/analytics_events_registry_test.dart

# Release readiness (requires RC_USE_PROD=true in .env) — or invoke /dev-ops-release
flutter test test/release_readiness_test.dart

# Supabase (Certidões PJ — see docs/SUPABASE.md)
supabase link --project-ref kpkctuuzhbnqudemeudh
supabase functions deploy sync-profile
supabase functions deploy create-order
supabase functions deploy create-pix-order
supabase functions deploy pagarme-webhook
supabase functions deploy sync-payment-status
supabase functions deploy send-marketing-emails
supabase secrets set KEY=value
```

