## Project structure

```
lib/
├── core/                    # Global config, utilities
│   ├── helpers/             # FirebaseAnalyticsHelper
│   └── utils/               # AppTypography, DeviceScaleUtils
├── domain/
│   ├── models/              # Freezed models (CnpjModel, NomeModel, etc.)
│   └── providers/           # Riverpod @riverpod notifiers
├── presentation/            # Feature screens + local widgets
│   ├── splash_screen/
│   ├── home_screen/         # Search, banners, historic/favorites tabs
│   ├── result_screen/       # Company detail (4 tabs)
│   ├── paywall_screen/
│   ├── search_advanced_screen/
│   ├── calculator_screen/
│   ├── refer_friend_screen/
│   ├── evaluation_screen/
│   ├── not_available_screen/
│   ├── settings_screen/
│   └── shared/widgets/      # CnpjPrimaryButton, PremiumUpsellSheet, etc.
├── services/                # Singleton I/O (HTTP, Firebase, RevenueCat, local storage)
├── routes/                  # AppRoutes — named routes with typed args
├── theme/                   # app_theme.dart + cupertino_theme.dart
└── main.dart

assets/
├── icons/                   # SVG icons (from legacy app)
├── images/                  # SVG illustrations
└── config/                  # design.json, remote_config.json, analytics_events.json

docs/
├── IOS_SETUP.md             # iOS manual setup checklist
└── SUPABASE.md              # Certidões PJ Supabase anchor (link/deploy/secrets)

supabase/                    # Certidões PJ backend (source of truth)
├── config.toml              # project_id = kpkctuuzhbnqudemeudh
├── functions/               # create-pix-order, pagarme-webhook, sync-payment-status, send-marketing-emails
└── migrations/
```

