## Navigation

Named routes only via `AppRoutes`. Pass arguments as typed objects (`CnpjModel`, `PaywallOrigin`, `SearchParam`, etc.). Never navigate with raw strings or anonymous routes.

Key routes: `/`, `/home`, `/result`, `/paywall`, `/search-advanced`, `/calculator`, `/refer-friend`, `/evaluation`, `/not-available`, `/settings`.

---

## External APIs

| Service | Base URL | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| ReceitaWS | `https://www.receitaws.com.br/v1/` | GET `cnpj/{digits}` |
| ASW | `http://api.consultarempresas.com.br:8888/` | Name search |

iOS requires ATS exception for ASW HTTP endpoint (see `docs/IOS_SETUP.md`).

---

## Efficiency

Scope prompts precisely (e.g. review one file or feature instead of the whole app). Less context loaded means fewer tokens and clearer answers.
